@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

### Crear albarán (horas)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deliverynote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client": "CLIENT_ID",
  "project": "PROJECT_ID",
  "format": "hours",
  "description": "Trabajo de pintura",
  "workDate": "2025-01-15",
  "hours": 8,
  "workers": [
    { "name": "Juan Pérez", "hours": 8 },
    { "name": "María López", "hours": 6 }
  ]
}

### Crear albarán (material)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deliverynote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client": "CLIENT_ID",
  "project": "PROJECT_ID",
  "format": "material",
  "description": "Suministro de materiales",
  "workDate": "2025-01-15",
  "material": "Cemento",
  "quantity": 50,
  "unit": "bolsas"
}

### Listar albaranes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deliverynote?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrar albaranes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deliverynote?project=PROJECT_ID&client=CLIENT_ID&format=hours&signed=false&from=2025-01-01&to=2025-12-31&sort=-workDate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener albarán por ID (populate)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deliverynote/DELIVERYNOTE_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Descargar PDF del albarán
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deliverynote/pdf/DELIVERYNOTE_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Firmar albarán (con imagen de firma)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/deliverynote/DELIVERYNOTE_ID/sign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

file: @firma.png

### Eliminar albarán (solo si no está firmado)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/deliverynote/DELIVERYNOTE_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
